# Knob acceleration: a few clicks are exact at any speed, a quick spin sweeps. On the DRUMS sound
# page, 909 BD Tune (0..127) starts at 34.
wait 300
# TCLS: EDIT opens the cursor role's sound page (DRUMS -> the 909; the selected track is BD).
tap EDIT
expect view 1
expect sound0.0.0 34
# slow, 80 ms a detent: one step each
turn K1 5 80
expect sound0.0.0 39
# quick, 10 ms a detent: the first three one each, then 8 each, so ten detents sweep most of the range
turn K1 10 10
expect sound0.0.0 98
# three quick clicks (30 ms apart): one each, no acceleration
wait 500
turn K1 -3 30
expect sound0.0.0 95
# a quick full sweep down, then fine steps back up
wait 500
turn K1 -16 10
expect sound0.0.0 0
wait 500
turn K1 2 100
expect sound0.0.0 2
# the wide-range TEMPO knob on GLOBAL's PERFORM page: a slow turn is one BPM a detent
tap HOME
tap GLO
expect view 5
turn K1 5 100
expect tempo 130
